cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this image in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "r-ml-base: R and Plumber base image with pre-installed machine learning packages"
abstract: >-
  Base Docker image for R services built with Plumber, with computationally
  expensive machine learning packages (caret, randomForest, kernlab, fastshap,
  shapviz and others) pre-installed, so that dependent services build faster.
authors:
  - given-names: "Sérgio Souza"
    family-names: "Costa"
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal do Maranhão (UFMA), LambdaGeo Research Group"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/profsergiocosta/r-ml-base"
keywords:
  - R
  - Plumber
  - Docker
  - machine learning
  - caret
  - reproducibility
